        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■The first-ever game adaptation of a hugely popular IP</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;A Wild Last Boss Appeared!&quot; is a massively popular dark fantasy isekai series, based on the original work by FireHead, with original illustrations and character designs by YahaKo (published by Earth Star Novel, an imprint of Earth Star Entertainment), and a manga adaptation by Hazuki Tsubasa.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The anime is also now streaming to great acclaim!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the first-ever game adaptation of &quot;A Wild Last Boss Appeared!&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844180/extras/7d558bac5f6c44a108bd3f282e8cf300.poster.avif?t=1784797162\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844180/extras/7d558bac5f6c44a108bd3f282e8cf300.webm?t=1784797162\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844180/extras/7d558bac5f6c44a108bd3f282e8cf300.mp4?t=1784797162\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-----------------</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■An aggressive arena shooter game system.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The most distinctive feature is the &quot;aggressive&quot; playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The greatest opportunities arise when a large number of enemies appear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can lock on to and snipe the summoner to defeat entire groups of enemies at once.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the thrill of crushing dozens of monsters all at once.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844180/extras/79a5661f87fa8f807d6c0634b64f2754.poster.avif?t=1784797162\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844180/extras/79a5661f87fa8f807d6c0634b64f2754.webm?t=1784797162\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844180/extras/79a5661f87fa8f807d6c0634b64f2754.mp4?t=1784797162\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■Active skills to wipe out swarming enemies.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The characters of &quot;A Wild Last Boss Appeared!&quot; all possess powerful skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, these can be activated as active skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Winter of Swords&quot; - Forge and project numerous swords at your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844180/extras/4f33bbe64d2ad7c9b769a19b257c8dbc.avif?t=1784797162\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > &quot;Suzuki Attack&quot; - Transforms into a robot and mows down enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844180/extras/11ca4400e47ace8877754916abfdca1f.poster.avif?t=1784797162\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844180/extras/11ca4400e47ace8877754916abfdca1f.webm?t=1784797162\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844180/extras/11ca4400e47ace8877754916abfdca1f.mp4?t=1784797162\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Rainbow Sheep&quot; - Transform into a giant monster and crush your foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844180/extras/87c64330d826961d74f36b2afd9787db.avif?t=1784797162\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wipe out the swarming enemies with the unique ultimate skills of the five characters.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game features a completely original story made exclusively for the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844180/extras/7013edd66111a60de5f362bc5ae1cb53.avif?t=1784797162\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There will also be sub-scenarios for each character and special graphics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844180/extras/c085418dc7e7c227caa25c766551d95a.avif?t=1784797162\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844180/extras_big/c085418dc7e7c227caa25c766551d95a.avif?t=1784797162 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the exploits of the characters, unique to this game and presented in full voice.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&lt;Synopsis&gt;</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is set in the idyllic town of Mimir.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the center of the town stood a giant tower called Mystletine Tower.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On their way to Blutgang, Lufas and her party stop in this town and meet a person named Maia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guided by Maia into the tower, they find themselves in a mysterious space where their levels are forcibly decreased.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Curious about Maia's true identity, Lufas decides to challenge the tower.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844180/extras/85e3bb3e5c31881962f997ed222dc86d.avif?t=1784797162\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■The first-ever game adaptation of a hugely popular IP</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;A Wild Last Boss Appeared!&quot; is a massively popular dark fantasy isekai series, based on the original work by FireHead, with original illustrations and character designs by YahaKo (published by Earth Star Novel, an imprint of Earth Star Entertainment), and a manga adaptation by Hazuki Tsubasa.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The anime is also now streaming to great acclaim!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the first-ever game adaptation of &quot;A Wild Last Boss Appeared!&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844180/extras/7d558bac5f6c44a108bd3f282e8cf300.poster.avif?t=1784797162\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844180/extras/7d558bac5f6c44a108bd3f282e8cf300.webm?t=1784797162\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844180/extras/7d558bac5f6c44a108bd3f282e8cf300.mp4?t=1784797162\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-----------------</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■An aggressive arena shooter game system.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The most distinctive feature is the &quot;aggressive&quot; playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The greatest opportunities arise when a large number of enemies appear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can lock on to and snipe the summoner to defeat entire groups of enemies at once.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the thrill of crushing dozens of monsters all at once.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844180/extras/79a5661f87fa8f807d6c0634b64f2754.poster.avif?t=1784797162\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844180/extras/79a5661f87fa8f807d6c0634b64f2754.webm?t=1784797162\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844180/extras/79a5661f87fa8f807d6c0634b64f2754.mp4?t=1784797162\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■Active skills to wipe out swarming enemies.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The characters of &quot;A Wild Last Boss Appeared!&quot; all possess powerful skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, these can be activated as active skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Winter of Swords&quot; - Forge and project numerous swords at your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844180/extras/4f33bbe64d2ad7c9b769a19b257c8dbc.avif?t=1784797162\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > &quot;Suzuki Attack&quot; - Transforms into a robot and mows down enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844180/extras/11ca4400e47ace8877754916abfdca1f.poster.avif?t=1784797162\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844180/extras/11ca4400e47ace8877754916abfdca1f.webm?t=1784797162\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844180/extras/11ca4400e47ace8877754916abfdca1f.mp4?t=1784797162\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Rainbow Sheep&quot; - Transform into a giant monster and crush your foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844180/extras/87c64330d826961d74f36b2afd9787db.avif?t=1784797162\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wipe out the swarming enemies with the unique ultimate skills of the five characters.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game features a completely original story made exclusively for the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844180/extras/7013edd66111a60de5f362bc5ae1cb53.avif?t=1784797162\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There will also be sub-scenarios for each character and special graphics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844180/extras/c085418dc7e7c227caa25c766551d95a.avif?t=1784797162\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844180/extras_big/c085418dc7e7c227caa25c766551d95a.avif?t=1784797162 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the exploits of the characters, unique to this game and presented in full voice.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&lt;Synopsis&gt;</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is set in the idyllic town of Mimir.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the center of the town stood a giant tower called Mystletine Tower.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On their way to Blutgang, Lufas and her party stop in this town and meet a person named Maia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guided by Maia into the tower, they find themselves in a mysterious space where their levels are forcibly decreased.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Curious about Maia's true identity, Lufas decides to challenge the tower.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844180/extras/85e3bb3e5c31881962f997ed222dc86d.avif?t=1784797162\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>",
